462 0 obj
<<
/Title (Automated Matrix Inversion: The large 8x8 block represents the inverted active stiffness matrix computed using Excel's native array functionalities. This operation yields the precise engineering displacements under the applied loading conditions. For example, Node 3 displaces horizontally by 0.021333 inches \(U5\) and vertically by 0.040836 inches \(U6\).)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 464 0 R
/Next 454 0 R
>>
endobj
