>>
endobj
464 0 obj
<<
/Title (The Active Partition Formula: The upper section executes the partitioned matrix equation to isolate and calculate unknown active translations. Because the support constraints are fixed at zero, the expression effectively reduces to multiplying the inverted active stiffness matrix by the applied external force vector.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 466 0 R
/Next 462 0 R
>>
endobj
