466 0 obj
<<
/Title (Notice the external numbers tracking along the top and left sides of each block \(ranging from 1 to 12\). These are the global addresses \(Degrees of Freedom\). They act like a precise routing index, showing exactly which structural joints move and where that specific element's stiffness pushes back against the system.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 468 0 R
/First 469 0 R
/Last 469 0 R
/Count -1
/Next 464 0 R
>>
endobj
