/Title (Automated Axial Stiffness Evaluation \(k\): The spreadsheet automatically runs a cell-by-cell calculation of the standard 1D truss axial stiffness: Stiffness Factor k = \(A x E\) / L This scales the raw material resistance against the physical dimensions of the member.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
